{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Headliner_01.png?t=1744883977\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Red Core Division</strong> is a co-op survival horror game for 1\u20134 players. Your mission: infiltrate a top-secret containment zone where the line between reality and nightmare has broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face unspeakable horrors, complete deadly objectives, and uncover the truth hidden across three distinct, chilling locations. But beware\u2014something ancient and violent lurks in the shadows\u2026 and it\u2019s hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Teammate.gif?t=1744883977\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Headliner_04.png?t=1744883977\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From creaking suburban homes and abandoned hospitals to pitch-black industrial corridors\u2014you\u2019ll explore a variety of terrifying environments, each with unique objectives, layouts, and horrors waiting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run throws you into a new scenario, forcing your team to adapt, survive, and escape... if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Locations.gif?t=1744883977\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Headliner_02.png?t=1744883977\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use proximity voice chat to stay in touch with your squad\u2026 if you dare. The creatures that stalk these halls are drawn to sound. A single word might reveal your location. Silence can be safety\u2014or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every footstep, every breath, every moment counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/NotAlone.gif?t=1744883977\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Headliner_03.png?t=1744883977\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together to investigate paranormal zones, gather crucial evidence, and survive long enough to exfil. Each mission is packed with high-stakes tasks, randomized events, and shifting threats that force your team to adapt\u2014or fall apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Valves.gif?t=1744883977\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Headliner_05.png?t=1744883977\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t just about jumpscares. Red Core Division features dynamic enemies that react to player behavior, environment, and noise. Hide, run, or fight\u2014but every encounter is a test of your nerves and your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019re not just looking for you. They\u2019re hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/Encounter.gif?t=1744883977\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629570?t=1744883977","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629570?t=1744883977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/b7a05e4d503e5b8e4d3e35e14ad8ac344a448b2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744883977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/b7a05e4d503e5b8e4d